Z||000028||WKDFIRO||10-12-2001||10:43 AM|||| <P>Get up pretty early? Thats the fun part of it! You make it sound like a chore! Isn't the idea of having a Fiero DRIVING IT?<P>When you are out here in Riverside, you take it as fact that you are FAR from EVERYTHING. Being out here in Riverside also gives us the chance to caravan into an event, no matter how early it is. Im right off of Green River Drive and there is a choice meeting spot just off the freeway at the Carls Jr. if you guys ever want to get together for a run out west and want to arrive in Marina Del Rey in force. Let me know. Sure we could have everyone come out here or even meet in Orange County somewhere...The Block comes to mind...hmmmmm.<P>Of course there is always the California Speedway...thats in OUR part of town...even if we don't go to the race, I hear there is an awesome swapmeet thing going on in the parking lot. Anyone have any info on the Speedway?||||reg||6
